+<A NAME="abort()"><!-- --></A><H3>
+abort</H3>
+<PRE>
+void <B>abort</B>()</PRE>
+<DL>
+<DD>Aborts this http request. Any active execution of this method should
+ return immediately. If the request has not started, it will abort after
+ the next execution. Aborting this request will cause all subsequent
+ executions with this request to fail.
+<P>
+<DD><DL>
+<DT><B>See Also:</B><DD><A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/HttpClient.html#execute(org.apache.http.client.methods.HttpUriRequest)"><CODE>HttpClient.execute(HttpUriRequest)</CODE></A>, 
