+</PRE>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>All Implemented Interfaces:</B> <DD><A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/Cloneable.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">Cloneable</A>, <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/methods/AbortableHttpRequest.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.client.methods">AbortableHttpRequest</A>, <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/methods/HttpUriRequest.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.client.methods">HttpUriRequest</A>, <A HREF="http://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-core-ga/httpcore/apidocs/org/apache/http/HttpMessage.html" title="class or interface in org.apache.http">HttpMessage</A>, <A HREF="http://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-core-ga/httpcore/apidocs/org/apache/http/HttpRequest.html" title="class or interface in org.apache.http">HttpRequest</A></DD>
