+</DL>
+<HR>
+<B>Deprecated.</B>&nbsp;<I>(4.2)  use <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/AuthenticationStrategy.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.client"><CODE>AuthenticationStrategy</CODE></A></I>
+<P>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE><FONT SIZE="-1"><A HREF="http://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-core-ga/httpcore/apidocs/org/apache/http/annotation/Immutable.html" title="class or interface in org.apache.http.annotation">@Immutable</A>
+<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/Deprecated.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">@Deprecated</A>
+</FONT>public class <B>ResponseAuthCache</B><DT>extends <A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/Object.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">Object</A><DT>implements <A HREF="http://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-core-ga/httpcore/apidocs/org/apache/http/HttpResponseInterceptor.html" title="class or interface in org.apache.http">HttpResponseInterceptor</A></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+Response interceptor that adds successfully completed <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/auth/AuthScheme.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.auth"><CODE>AuthScheme</CODE></A>s
+ to the local <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/AuthCache.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.client"><CODE>AuthCache</CODE></A> instance. Cached <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/auth/AuthScheme.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.auth"><CODE>AuthScheme</CODE></A>s can be
+ re-used when executing requests against known hosts, thus avoiding
+ additional authentication round-trips.
+<P>
+
+<P>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>Since:</B></DT>
+  <DD>4.1</DD>
+</DL>
