+<H2>
+<FONT SIZE="-1">
+org.apache.http.conn</FONT>
+<BR>
+Interface EofSensorWatcher</H2>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>All Known Implementing Classes:</B> <DD><A HREF="../../../../org/apache/http/conn/BasicEofSensorWatcher.html" title="class in org.apache.http.conn">BasicEofSensorWatcher</A>, <A HREF="../../../../org/apache/http/conn/BasicManagedEntity.html" title="class in org.apache.http.conn">BasicManagedEntity</A></DD>
+</DL>
+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE>public interface <B>EofSensorWatcher</B></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+A watcher for <A HREF="../../../../org/apache/http/conn/EofSensorInputStream.html" title="class in org.apache.http.conn"><CODE>EofSensorInputStream</CODE></A>. Each stream will notify its
+ watcher at most once.
+<P>
+
+<P>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>Since:</B></DT>
+  <DD>4.0</DD>
+</DL>
+<HR>
+
+<P>
