+<DT><B>Throws:</B>
+<DD><CODE><A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/io/IOException.html" title="class or interface in java.io">IOException</A></CODE> - in case of a problem</DL>
+</DD>
+</DL>
