+determineRoute</H3>
+<PRE>
+<A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/conn/routing/HttpRoute.html" title="class in org.apache.http.conn.routing">HttpRoute</A> <B>determineRoute</B>(<A HREF="http://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-core-ga/httpcore/apidocs/org/apache/http/HttpHost.html" title="class or interface in org.apache.http">HttpHost</A>&nbsp;target,
