+<DL>
+<DT><PRE>public static enum <B>RouteInfo.TunnelType</B><DT>extends <A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/Enum.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">Enum</A>&lt;<A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/conn/routing/RouteInfo.TunnelType.html" title="enum in org.apache.http.conn.routing">RouteInfo.TunnelType</A>&gt;</DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+The tunnelling type of a route.
+ Plain routes are established by   connecting to the target or
+ the first proxy.
+ Tunnelled routes are established by connecting to the first proxy
+ and tunnelling through all proxies to the target.
+ Routes without a proxy cannot be tunnelled.
+<P>
+
