+<DL>
+<DT><B>All Known Subinterfaces:</B> <DD><A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/conn/scheme/LayeredSchemeSocketFactory.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.conn.scheme">LayeredSchemeSocketFactory</A>, <A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/conn/scheme/SchemeLayeredSocketFactory.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.conn.scheme">SchemeLayeredSocketFactory</A></DD>
