+</DL>
+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE>public interface <B>SchemeSocketFactory</B></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+A factory for creating, initializing and connecting sockets. The factory encapsulates the logic
+ for establishing a socket connection.
+<P>
+
+<P>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>Since:</B></DT>
+  <DD>4.1</DD>
+</DL>
+<HR>
+
