+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE>public interface <B>X509HostnameVerifier</B><DT>extends <A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/javax/net/ssl/HostnameVerifier.html" title="class or interface in javax.net.ssl">HostnameVerifier</A></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+Interface for checking if a hostname matches the names stored inside the
+ server's X.509 certificate.  This interface extends
+ <A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/javax/net/ssl/HostnameVerifier.html" title="class or interface in javax.net.ssl"><CODE>HostnameVerifier</CODE></A>, but it is recommended to use
+ methods added by X509HostnameVerifier.
+<P>
+
+<P>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>Since:</B></DT>
+  <DD>4.0</DD>
+</DL>
+<HR>
