+
+<P>
+This cookie comparator can be used to compare identity of cookies.
+ <p>
+  Cookies are considered identical if their names are equal and
+  their domain attributes match ignoring case.
+<P>
+
+<P>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>Since:</B></DT>
+  <DD>4.0</DD>
