+setPerHostConnectionCap</H3>
+<PRE>
+public void <B>setPerHostConnectionCap</B>(int&nbsp;cap)</PRE>
+<DL>
+<DD>Sets the absolute maximum per-host connection pool size to
+ probe up to; defaults to 2 (the default per-host max).
+<P>
+<DD><DL>
+</DL>
+</DD>
+<DD><DL>
+<DT><B>Parameters:</B><DD><CODE>cap</CODE> - must be >= 1</DL>
+</DD>
+</DL>
