+<DL>
+<DT><B>All Implemented Interfaces:</B> <DD><A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/client/ConnectionBackoffStrategy.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.client">ConnectionBackoffStrategy</A></DD>
