+</PRE>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>All Implemented Interfaces:</B> <DD><A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/conn/ConnectionKeepAliveStrategy.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.conn">ConnectionKeepAliveStrategy</A></DD>
