+</TR>
+</TABLE>
+
+<A NAME="hash(java.lang.String)"><!-- --></A><H3>
+hash</H3>
+<PRE>
+<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/String.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">String</A> <B>hash</B>(<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/String.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">String</A>&nbsp;storageKey)</PRE>
+<DL>
+<DD>Maps a storage key to a cache key. The storage key is what
+ the higher-level HTTP cache uses as a key; the cache key is what
+ we use as a key for talking to memcached.
+<P>
+<DD><DL>
