+<A NAME="getHttpCacheEntry()"><!-- --></A><H3>
+getHttpCacheEntry</H3>
+<PRE>
+<A HREF="../../../../../../../org/apache/http/client/cache/HttpCacheEntry.html" title="class in org.apache.http.client.cache">HttpCacheEntry</A> <B>getHttpCacheEntry</B>()</PRE>
+<DL>
+<DD>Returns the <A HREF="../../../../../../../org/apache/http/client/cache/HttpCacheEntry.html" title="class in org.apache.http.client.cache"><CODE>HttpCacheEntry</CODE></A> associated with this entry.
+ May return <code>null</code> if this is an "unset" instance
+ waiting to be <A HREF="../../../../../../../org/apache/http/impl/client/cache/memcached/MemcachedCacheEntry.html#set(byte[])"><CODE>set(byte[])</CODE></A> with a serialized
+ representation.
+<P>
+<DD><DL>
+</DL>
