+<BR>
+Class SHA256KeyHashingScheme</H2>
+<PRE>
+<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/Object.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">java.lang.Object</A>
+  <IMG SRC="../../../../../../../resources/inherit.gif" ALT="extended by "><B>org.apache.http.impl.client.cache.memcached.SHA256KeyHashingScheme</B>
+</PRE>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>All Implemented Interfaces:</B> <DD><A HREF="../../../../../../../org/apache/http/impl/client/cache/memcached/KeyHashingScheme.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.impl.client.cache.memcached">KeyHashingScheme</A></DD>
+</DL>
+<HR>
+<DL>
+<DT><PRE>public class <B>SHA256KeyHashingScheme</B><DT>extends <A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/lang/Object.html" title="class or interface in java.lang">Object</A><DT>implements <A HREF="../../../../../../../org/apache/http/impl/client/cache/memcached/KeyHashingScheme.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.impl.client.cache.memcached">KeyHashingScheme</A></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+This is a <A HREF="../../../../../../../org/apache/http/impl/client/cache/memcached/KeyHashingScheme.html" title="interface in org.apache.http.impl.client.cache.memcached"><CODE>KeyHashingScheme</CODE></A> based on the
+ <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2">SHA-256</a>
+ algorithm. The hashes produced are hex-encoded SHA-256
+ digests and hence are always 64-character hexadecimal
+ strings.
+<P>
